{\small\bfseries\itshape\color[HTML]{B0401E} Draft --- September 2026. Not for external distribution; contents subject to change ahead of first release.}\par
\vspace{14pt}
{\small\color[HTML]{5F5E5A} Prepared as an internal guide on adopting FINOS's AI Governance Framework (AIGF) and its surrounding Governance-as-Code pipeline for agentic AI in financial services.}\par
\vspace{10pt}
{\small\color[HTML]{5F5E5A} This guide references and draws on the open-source FINOS AI Governance Framework, CALM, and Fluxnova projects, the AIUC-1 certification standard, and the Linux Foundation's Tokenomics Foundation. Full sources are listed in the References chapter at the end of this guide.}\par
